  "case": "rs_parity_deepvue",
  "kind": "rs_parity",
  "note": "Cross-vendor parity for the UCT RS Rating (design round 2026-11-08), read by tests/test_rs_parity_deepvue.py. Both sides are as recorded in the review docs/research/relative-strength/reviews/2026-11-08-deepvue-parity.md (uct-rs-plan) and its computation 2026-11-08-deepvue-parity.py, copied here value for value. Nothing is recomputed from bars: this fixture is a measurement record, and the test checks the agreement it reports so a later re-read that drifts reds it.",
